{# Global "total packs sold" counter — a split-flap / seven-segment board in a
   chrome bezel, directly under the header. Mirrors the campaign hero banner:
   glowing LED digits on deep navy, digits mid-roll when the figure moves.

   ── Where the number comes from ─────────────────────────────────────────────
   The pipeline (salla-pipeline.onrender.com) owns the figure and already does
   the packs maths — ordering 1 × a 32-pack product adds 32, not 1. The theme
   renders `total` verbatim and never multiplies anything. Spec:
   PACKS_COUNTER_SPEC.md + the pipeline's integration artifact.

   ── Why nothing is server-rendered ──────────────────────────────────────────
   A Twig-side figure would paint stale for every visitor served a cached page.
   The bar ships `hidden`; qissa-packs-counter.js reveals it only once a real
   number has arrived, so a dead endpoint leaves no empty chrome behind.

   ── Accessibility split ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   The board is pure glowing <span> geometry with no text, so it's aria-hidden;
   the screen-reader value lives in the visually-hidden sibling instead. That
   also keeps aria-live from re-announcing the Arabic label on every tick.

   Included from header.twig (kept as its own file so the SSE wiring and the
   segment styles stay out of the header markup). The cart/checkout exclusion
   lives here so the rule travels with the component.
#}
{% set on_cart = page.slug starts with 'cart' or page.slug starts with 'checkout' %}

{% if theme.settings.get('packs_counter_enabled', true) and not on_cart %}
    {% set base = theme.settings.get('packs_counter_endpoint', 'https://salla-pipeline.onrender.com')|trim %}

    {% if base %}
        <div class="qpacks" data-qpacks data-endpoint="{{ base }}" hidden>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="qpacks__inner">
                    <span class="qpacks__display" data-qpacks-board aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="qpacks__label">{{ theme.settings.get('packs_counter_label', 'منديل بين أيدي عملائنا') }}</span>
                    <span class="qpacks__sr" data-qpacks-sr role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
